  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Distance Education Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Educacin a Distancia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT WILL INTRODUCE BASIC EDUCATION EQUIVALENCY FOR OUT OF SCHOOL YOUTH AND ADULTS, EXPAND SECONDARY COVERAGE TO RURAL  URBAN MARGINAL AND WORKING YOUTHS UNABLE TO ATTEND FULL TIME SECONDARY SCHOOL AND INTRODUCE DISTANCE LEARNING FOR FURTHER EDUCATION (MEDIA SUPERIOR). IT WILL SUPPORT THE DEVELOPMENT OF CENTRAL FACILITIES FOR THE ARCHIVING, PRODUCTION AND EVALUATION OF EXTANT MEDIA OF EDUCATIONAL IMPORTANCE AND PILOT INTERACTIVE MEDIA IN EDUCATION</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
